{
    "title": "Matnnegar (Write On Photos)",
    "description": "Matnnegar is a typography application and first released on 2015 Nov, You can easily design beautiful typographies by Matnnegar.\r\n\r\nMain Design page contains 3 tabs: Text, Background, Sticker:\r\n\r\nIn Text tab, there are various options to edit texts such as Text colour, Text shadow, Text eraser, Emboss and etc..\r\n\r\nIn the Background tab, you can choose the main photo and choose effects. There are many photos in various categories in Online Gallery.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn Sticker tab, you can choose custom stickers. all of the Text options are almost available for stickers. Many stickers in various categories are waiting for you in Online Stickers.\r\n\r\nAnd of course, you can save your editing as Project and even share with your friends.\r\n\r\nif you need more fonts, stickers or projects you can pick from PencilCase.\r\n\r\n*** To access LOCAL FONTS copy your fonts to matnnegar > fonts folder ***",
    "descriptionHTML": "Matnnegar is a typography application and first released on 2015 Nov, You can easily design beautiful typographies by Matnnegar.<br><br>Main Design page contains 3 tabs: Text, Background, Sticker:<br><br>In Text tab, there are various options to edit texts such as Text colour, Text shadow, Text eraser, Emboss and etc..<br><br>In the Background tab, you can choose the main photo and choose effects. There are many photos in various categories in Online Gallery.<br><br><br>In Sticker tab, you can choose custom stickers. all of the Text options are almost available for stickers. Many stickers in various categories are waiting for you in Online Stickers.<br><br>And of course, you can save your editing as Project and even share with your friends.<br><br>if you need more fonts, stickers or projects you can pick from PencilCase.<br><br>*** To access LOCAL FONTS copy your fonts to matnnegar &gt; fonts folder ***",
